{"id":"c7beb78bfca18f0d","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-exp-nexp-padding.md","title":"Padding from P versus NP to EXP versus NEXP","display":"thm-exp-nexp-padding — Padding from P versus NP to EXP versus NEXP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-exp-nexp-padding","aliases":["28-thm-exp-nexp-padding"],"display":"thm-exp-nexp-padding — Padding from P versus NP to EXP versus NEXP","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-exp]]","[[28-df-nexp]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-exp-nexp-padding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-exp-nexp-padding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-exp-nexp-padding — Padding from P versus NP to EXP versus NEXP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e2f71764c556aa9\" href=\"?note=5e2f71764c556aa9\" title=\"28-df-exp\">28-df-exp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75ba006af50075ad\" href=\"?note=75ba006af50075ad\" title=\"28-df-nexp\">28-df-nexp</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{EXP},\\mathbf{NEXP}\">\\(\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{EXP},\\mathbf{NEXP}\\)</span> 采用本目录资源并类定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{EXP}=\\mathbf{NEXP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{EXP}=\\mathbf{NEXP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{EXP}\\ne\\mathbf{NEXP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{EXP}\\ne\\mathbf{NEXP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 可在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n^a}\">\\(2^{n^a}\\)</span> 非确定时间决定，则把输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 填充为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,1^{2^{|x|^a}}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,1^{2^{|x|^a}}\\rangle\\)</span> 后可在填充长度的多项式时间内作非确定模拟，得到 NP 语言。在 P=NP 下，它有确定型多项式算法；产生填充并运行算法，整体仍为原输入长度的指数时间。故 NEXP 包含于 EXP，反向由机器特例成立。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.22及证明；印刷57页；PDF83页。填充语言及运行时间推导已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-exp","status":"resolved","id":"5e2f71764c556aa9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-exp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nexp","status":"resolved","id":"75ba006af50075ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nexp]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{EXP},\\mathbf{NEXP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{EXP}=\\mathbf{NEXP}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{EXP}\\ne\\mathbf{NEXP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}.","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n^a}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,1^{2^{|x|^a}}\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":1202,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"归约、搜索与层级扩充：[[28-thm-np-hardness-consequences]]、[[28-thm-exp-nexp-padding]]、[[28-thm-np-search-to-decision]]、[[28-thm-ph-oracle-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["dd9febae42d44280","0cb5248561455df8","5e2f71764c556aa9","75ba006af50075ad"]}